### **Project: Discord Options Flow Tracker & Dashboard**

#### **1. Core Objective**
Build an automated system to listen for "whale" option alerts from a specific Discord channel, track their performance using ThetaData, and visualize the "Win Rate" (defined as reaching +20% profit) on a Streamlit dashboard.

